@startwbs
' Ownership tree (STYLE rule 19): who owns what, top to bottom, elbow lines by construction.
' Edit below the end marker. An authority matrix (who decides, who is told) goes in the legend as
' a Creole table. The same header starts templates/skeleton-cause-tree.puml.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
wbsDiagram {
  .data { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
  .process { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
  .tooling { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
  .people { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
  .failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
  .gate { BackgroundColor #FFFFFF; LineThickness 2 }
}
</style>
' house-preamble-end

title Ownership tree for <scope> (as-of date)

* Replace: owner (team or role)
** Replace: area A
*** Replace: system or repo
*** Replace: system or repo
** Replace: area B
*** Replace: system or repo

legend right
  |= Decision |= Decides |= Consulted |= Told |
  | Replace: deploy to prod | Replace: role | Replace: role | Replace: role |
endlegend
@endwbs
